WEBVTT

1
00:00:06.067 --> 00:00:10.371
My Aunt Sunny's wedding is coming up.

2
00:00:10.372 --> 00:00:16.017
She must be very excited!

3
00:00:16.018 --> 00:00:19.255
Mom: Look! This is Union Square.

4
00:00:19.256 --> 00:00:22.718
Hana: Wow, this place is huge.

5
00:00:22.719 --> 00:00:25.769
Look at all the people and the stores.

6
00:00:25.770 --> 00:00:30.955
Hana: Are you getting something for Dad?

7
00:00:30.956 --> 00:00:32.988
Mom: No, not for him.

8
00:00:32.989 --> 00:00:34.589
It's for Aunt Sunny.

9
00:00:34.590 --> 00:00:37.528
Mom: We are having a bridal shower tomorrow.

10
00:00:37.529 --> 00:00:40.049
Hana: A bridal shower?

11
00:00:40.050 --> 00:00:44.086
What is that?

12
00:00:44.087 --> 00:00:46.692
Mom: The bridal shower is a party.

13
00:00:46.693 --> 00:00:49.623
We prepare many gifts for the bride.

14
00:00:49.624 --> 00:00:56.790
Hana: That's interesting. What are you going to buy, Mom?

15
00:00:56.791 --> 00:00:59.798
Mom: I'm going to buy her a tablecloth.

16
00:00:59.799 --> 00:01:03.162
Mom: There. Let's look at the store directory.

17
00:01:03.163 --> 00:01:08.795
Mom: Home interior . . . Ah, here it is. H24.

18
00:01:08.796 --> 00:01:10.626
Mom: Are you hungry?

19
00:01:10.627 --> 00:01:13.809
Bada: No, Mom.

20
00:01:13.810 --> 00:01:15.969
Hana: I'm hungry, Mom.

21
00:01:15.970 --> 00:01:17.834
Mom: We'll eat after we shop.

22
00:01:17.835 --> 00:01:19.292
Is that Okay?

23
00:01:19.293 --> 00:01:23.362
Hana: Sounds good.

24
00:01:23.363 --> 00:01:32.071
I saw beautiful things to decorate the house with. Wow!
